# Naati Dhamaka

Himachali web radio. Static Angular SPA. Not a YouTube clone, not a streaming dashboard.

## Identity

- Product: **Naati Dhamaka**
- On-site title: **नाटी धमाका** (`lang="hi"`)
- Display font: **Yatra One**; UI font: Outfit; Devanagari UI: Noto Sans Devanagari
- Do not brand it as "Pahadi Radio" or "Pahadi Naati"
- No extra taglines, nav, login, sidebars, or playlist tables

## Stack

- Angular 21, standalone components, SCSS, signals, zoneless
- YouTube **IFrame Player API only** (real iframe)
- No backend, DB, Spotify, YouTube Data API, audio extraction, scraping, or ad bypass
- No new npm UI kits; CSS/SVG first
- Deploy as static files (`ng build` → `dist/naati-dhamaka/browser`)

## Architecture

```
src/app/core/          constants, models, youtube-player.service, station.service
src/app/features/radio radio.component (composes the page)
src/app/shared/        station-header, pahari-cap, now-playing, player-controls, radio-status
src/environments/      per-district playlist IDs
```

- UI never talks to `YT.Player` directly — only `YoutubePlayerService`
- District selection lives in `StationService` (default **shimla**)
- Clicking a district calls `switchPlaylist()` with `environment.youtube.playlists[id]`
- Change playlists in environment files, not in player logic
- Keep iframe in DOM at 200×200 (`.yt-engine`); custom radio UI is the experience

## Design (do not regress)

- Full-bleed background: `public/himachal-valley.png` (sharp Himachal balcony / valley photo)
- **No** wrapping `radio__content` glass card — title, cap, and player sit on the photo
- **No** `station__cap-line`
- District picker is a **circular Pahari/Kullu cap** (`app-pahari-cap`), 12 wedges, embroidered red–green–gold rim
- Selected district name shows **in the cap center** (Hindi + English); Shimla is 12 o’clock / default
- Compact player: cover thumbnail, title, district line, seek bar, icon controls
- Favicon is a round topi (`public/favicon.svg`)

## Future (do not build unless asked)

Multiple named stations, history, favorites, PWA, live counts, admin playlists.
